 of every sura to the number of the next sura, and accumulating the sums of sura numbers as we continue this process to the end of the Quran, we will have a value that corresponds to each sura. Thus, Sura 1 will have a corresponding value of 1, Sura 2 will have a value of 1+2=3, Sura 3 will have a value of 3+3=6, Sura 4 will have a value of 6+4 = 10, and so on to the end of the Quran. The total values for the initialed and the un-initialed suras are independently divisible by 19. The values for the initialed suras are shown in Table 17."}]},{"_type":"appendixDataTable","_key":"a18l","caption":{"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"a170","text":"Table 17: Values Obtained by Successive Addition of Sura Numbers"}]},"table":"plain","columns":[{"header":{"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"a171","text":"Sura Number"}]},"headerStyle":"leftSemibold","cellStyle":"monoPrimaryMediumTop"},{"header":{"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"a172","text":"Calculated Value"}]},"headerStyle":"leftSemibold","cellStyle":"plainTop"}],"rows":[{"_key":"a173","style":"data","cells":[{"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"a174","text":"2"}]},{"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"a175","text":"3"}]}]},{"_key":"a176","style":"data","cells":[{"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"a177","text":"3"}]},{"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"a178","text":"6"}]}]},{"_key":"a179","style":"data","cells":[{"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"a17a","text":"7"}]},{"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"a17b","text":"28"}]}]},{"_key":"a17c","style":"data","cells":[{"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"a17d","text":"10"}]},{"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"a17e","text":"55"}]}]},{"_key":"a17f","style":"data","cells":[{"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"a17g","text":"11"}]},{"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"a17h","text":"66"}]}]},{"_key":"a17i","style":"data","cells":[{"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"a17j","text":"12"}]},{"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"a17k","text":"78"}]}]},{"_key":"a17l","style":"data","cells":[{"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"a17m","text":"13"}]},{"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"a17n","text":"91"}]}]},{"_key":"a17o","style":"data","cells":[{"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"a17p","text":"14"}]},{"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"a17q","text":"105"}]}]},{"_key":"a17r","style":"data","cells":[{"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"a17s","text":"15"}]},{"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"a17t","text":"120"}]}]},{"_key":"a17u","style":"data","cells":[{"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"a17v","text":"19"}]},{"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"a17w","text":"190"}]}]},{"_key":"a17x","style":"data","cells":[{"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"a17y","text":"20"}]},{"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"a17z","text":"210"}]}]},{"_key":"a180","style":"dataEmphasised","cells":[{"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"a181","text":"—"}]},{"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"a182","text":"—"}]}]},{"_key":"a183","style":"data","cells":[{"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"a184","text":"44"}]},{"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"a185","text":"990"}]}]},{"_key":"a186","style":"data","cells":[{"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"a187","text":"45"}]},{"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"a188","text":"1035"}]}]},{"_key":"a189","style":"data","cells":[{"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"a18a","text":"46"}]},{"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"a18b","text":"1081"}]}]},{"_key":"a18c","style":"data","cells":[{"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"a18d","text":"50"}]},{"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"a18e","text":"1275"}]}]},{"_key":"a18f","style":"data","cells":[{"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"a18g","text":"68"}]},{"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"a18h","text":"2346"}]}]},{"_key":"a18i","style":"dataEmphasised","cells":[{"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"a18j","text":"Total"}]},{"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"a18k","text":"15675 (19×825)"}]}]}]},{"_type":"block","_key":"a18n","style":"normal","children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"a18m","text":"The values calculated for the un-initialed suras add up to a total of 237785, which is also a multiple of 19 (237785 = 19×12515)."}]},{"_type":"appendixDivider","_key":"a18o","title":{"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"a18p","text":"Mathematical Coding of Special Words — The Word “God” (Allah)"}]},"centered":true},{"_type":"appendixSection","_key":"a196","style":"prose","tag":"section","content":[{"_type":"appendixBadgeList","_key":"a18u","ordered":true,"style":"decimal","item":"none","content":"none","contentTag":"none","items":[{"_key":"a18q","text":{"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"a18r","text":"As shown earlier the word “God” occurs in the Quran 2698 times, 19×142."}]}},{"_key":"a18s","text":{"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"a18t","text":"The numbers of verses where the word “God” occurs add up to 118123, also a multiple of 19 (118123 = 19×6217)."}]}}]},{"_type":"block","_key":"a18w","style":"normal","children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"a18v","text":"These simple phenomena gave us many difficulties while simply counting the word “God.” We were a group of workers, equipped with computers, and all of us college graduates. Yet, we made several errors in counting, calculating, or simply writing the counts of the word “God.” Those who still claim that Muhammad was the author of the Quran are totally illogical; he never went to college, and he did not have a computer."}]},{"_type":"appendixBadgeList","_key":"a195","ordered":true,"style":"decimal","item":"none","content":"none","contentTag":"none","items":[{"_key":"a18x","text":{"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"a18y","text":"From the first Quranic Initials (A.L.M. 2:1) to the last initial (N. 68:1), there are 2641, 19×139, occurrences of the word “God.”"}]}},{"_key":"a18z","text":{"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"a190","text":"The word “God” occurs 57 times in the section outside the Initials (Table 18)."}]}},{"_key":"a191","text":{"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"a192","text":"By adding the numbers of the suras and verses where these 57 occurrences of the word “God” are found, we get a total of 2432, or 19×128. See Table 18."}]}},{"_key":"a193","text":{"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"a194","text":"The word “God” occurs in 85 suras. If we add the number of each sura to the number of verses between the first and last occurrences of the word “God,” both verses inclusive, the Grand Total comes to 8170 or 19×430. An abbreviated representation of the data is shown in Table 19."}]}}]}]},{"_type":"appendixDataTable","_key":"a1bv","caption":{"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"a197","text":"Table 18: Occurrence of the Word \"God\" outside the Initialed Section"}]},"table":"plain","columns":[{"header":{"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"a198","text":"Number of Sura"}]},"headerStyle":"leftSemibold","cellStyle":"monoPrimaryMediumTop"},{"header":{"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"a199","text":"Numbers of Verses"}]},"headerStyle":"leftSemibold","cellStyle":"plainTop"},{"header":{"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"a19a","text":"Number of Occurrences"}]},"headerStyle":"leftSemibold","cellStyle":"plainTop"}],"rows":[{"_key":"a19b","style":"data","cells":[{"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"a19c","text":"1"}]},{"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"a19d","text":"1, 2"}]},{"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"a19e","text":"2"}]}]},{"_key":"a19f","style":"data","cells":[{"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"a19g","text":"69"}]},{"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"a19h","text":"33"}]},{"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"a19i","text":"1"}]}]},{"_key":"a19j","style":"data","cells":[{"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"a19k","text":"70"}]},{"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"a19l","text":"3"}]},{"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"a19m","text":"1"}]}]},{"_key":"a19n","style":"data","cells":[{"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"a19o","text":"71"}]},{"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"a19p","text":"3, 4, 13, 15, 17, 19, 25"}]},{"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"a19q","text":"7"}