ab5","text":"By adding the sura number of the un-initialed suras, plus the number of verses, plus the sum of verse numbers from the missing Basmalah (9:1) to the end of the Quran, the grand total comes to 116090, or 19×6110. These data are in Table 6. If Verses 9:128-129 are included, the number of verses for Sura 9 becomes 129, and the grand total becomes 116349, not a multiple of 19."}]},{"_type":"appendixDataTable","_key":"ac4","caption":{"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"ab7","text":"Table 6: The un-initialed suras & their verses from missing Basmalah (Sura 9) to the end of the Quran"}]},"table":"collapse","columns":[{"header":{"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"ab8","text":"Sura No."}]},"headerStyle":"leftNowrap","cellStyle":"tightMonoNowrapPrimary"},{"header":{"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"ab9","text":"No. of Verses"}]},"headerStyle":"leftNowrap","cellStyle":"tightMonoNowrapFaded"},{"header":{"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"aba","text":"Sum of Verse #’s"}]},"headerStyle":"leftNowrap","cellStyle":"tightMonoNowrapFaded"},{"header":{"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"abb","text":"Total"}]},"headerStyle":"leftNowrap","cellStyle":"tightMonoNowrapFaded"}],"rows":[{"_key":"abc","style":"data","cells":[{"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"abd","text":"9"}]},{"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"abe","text":"127"}]},{"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"abf","text":"8128"}]},{"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"abg","text":"8264"}]}]},{"_key":"abh","style":"data","cells":[{"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"abi","text":"16"}]},{"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"abj","text":"128"}]},{"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"abk","text":"8256"}]},{"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"abl","text":"8400"}]}]},{"_key":"abm","style":"data","cells":[{"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"abn","text":"–"}]},{"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"abo","text":"–"}]},{"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"abp","text":"–"}]},{"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"abq","text":"–"}