":"totalsPrimary","cells":[{"children":[]},{"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"alg","text":"2546"}]},{"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"alh","text":"1641"}]},{"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"ali","text":"908"}]},{"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"alj","text":"833"}]},{"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"alk","text":"5928"}]}],"cellStyles":["monoPrimaryNowrap","monoPrimaryNowrap","monoPrimaryNowrap","monoPrimaryNowrap","monoPrimaryNowrap","monoPrimaryNowrap"]},{"_key":"all","style":"totalsPlain","cells":[{"children":[]},{"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"alm","text":"(19×134)"}]},{"children":[]},{"children":[]},{"children":[]},{"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"aln","text":"(19×312)"}]}],"cellStyles":["monoPrimaryNowrap","monoPrimaryNowrap","monoPrimaryNowrap","monoPrimaryNowrap","monoPrimaryNowrap","monoPrimaryNowrap"]}]}]},{"_type":"appendixEvidence","_key":"alp","n":22,"marker":"primary","body":"evidenceBody","content":[{"_type":"block","_key":"als","style":"normal","children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"alr","text":"Since Sura 9 is an un-initialed sura, let us look at all the verse numbers in the 85 un-initialed suras and count all the 1’s we see. As shown in Table 10, the total count of the digit “1” in the un-initialed suras is 1406, or 19×74. Obviously, if Sura 9 consisted of 129 verses, we would see two additional 1’s, from 128 and 129, and the code would be violated."}]}]},{"_type":"appendixEvidence","_key":"alt","n":23,"marker":"primary","body":"evidenceBody","content":[{"_type":"block","_key":"alw","style":"normal","children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"alv","text":"Following the same process explained in Items 22 and 23 for the digit “1,” let us count all the 2’s, 8’s and 9’s in all the verse numbers of the whole Quran. As shown in Table 11, the total count of all the 2’s, 8’s, and 9’s is 3382, or 19×178. This makes the grand total of all the 1’s, 2’s, 8’s, and 9’s 2546+3382 = 5928, 19×312."}]},{"_type":"block","_key":"aly","style":"normal","children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"alx","text":"In this remarkable phenomenon, we considered every single verse in the Quran, and examined the individual digits that make up Verses 128 and 129. Since 128 and 129 contain 6 digits, the inclusion of these human injections causes the total count of these digits in the whole Quran to be 5928+6 = 5934, not a multiple of 19."}]}]},{"_type":"appendixEvidence","_key":"alz","n":24,"marker":"primary","body":"evidenceBody","content":[{"_type":"block","_key":"am2","style":"normal","children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"am1","text":"The total count of all the digits (1 through 9) in all the verse numbers of the 85 un-initialed suras, including Sura 9 with 127 verses, is 27075, or 19×19×75."}]}]},{"_type":"appendixEvidence","_key":"am3","n":25,"marker":"primary","body":"evidenceBody","content":[{"_type":"block","_key":"am6","style":"normal","children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"am5","text":"Adding up the digits of the Quran’s suras and verses produces a multiple of 19, provided the correct number of verses for Sura 9, 127, is taken. To do this, you make a list of the Quran’s 114 suras and the number of verses in each sura. Add the digits of every sura number. The sum of digits of 10=1, 11=2, 12=3, 99=18, and so on. The total for all the suras is 975. The same thing is done for the numbers of verses in every sura. For example, Sura 2 consists of 286 verses. The digits of 286 add up to 2+8+6=16. For Sura 9, the digits of its number of verses add up to 1+2+7=10. The total for all 114 suras is 906. Thus, the grand total for the sum of digits of all the suras and verses is 975+906 = 1881 = 19×99. Naturally, this observation would not be possible if Sura 9 consisted of 129 verses. Table 12 is abbreviated to illustrate the calculations."}]},{"_type":"appendixDataTable","_key":"anh","caption":{"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"am7","text":"Table 12: Sum of digits of all suras & verse numbers in the whole Quran"}]},"table":"collapse","columns":[{"header":{"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"ama","text":"Sura No."}]},"headerStyle":"leftNowrap","cellStyle":"tightMonoNowrapPrimary"},{"header":{"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"amb","text":"No. of Verses"}]},"headerStyle":"leftNowrap","cellStyle":"tightMonoNowrapFaded"},{"header":{"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"amc","text":"Sum of Digits of Suras"}]},"headerStyle":"leftNowrap","cellStyle":"tightMonoNowrapFaded"},{"header":{"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"amd","text":"Sum of Digits of Verses"}]},"headerStyle":"leftNowrap","cellStyle":"tightMonoNowrapFaded"}],"rows":[{"_key":"ame","style":"data","cells":[{"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"amf","text":"1"}]},{"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"amg","text":"7"}]},{"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"amh","text":"1"}]},{"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"ami","text":"7"}]}]},{"_key":"amj","style":"data","cells":[{"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"amk","text":"2"}]},{"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"aml","text":"286"}]},{"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"amm","text":"2"}]},{"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"amn","text":"16"}]}]},{"_key":"amo","style":"data","cells":[{"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"amp","text":"3"}]},{"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"amq","text":"200"}]},{"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"amr","text":"3"}]},{"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"ams","text":"2"}]}]},{"_key":"amt","style":"data","cells":[{"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"amu","text":"–"}]},{"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"amv","text":"–"}]},{"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"amw","text":"–"}]},{"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"amx","text":"–"}]}]},{"_key":"amy","style":"data","cells":[{"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"amz","text":"9"}]},{"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"an0","text":"127"}]},{"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"an1","text":"9"}]},{"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"an2","text":"10"}]}]},{"_key":"an3","style":"data","cells":[{"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"an4","text":"–"}]},{"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"an5","text":"–"}]},{"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"an6","text":"–"}]},{"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"an7","text":"–"}]}]},{"_key":"an8","style":"data","cells":[{"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"an9","text":"114"}]},{"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"ana","text":"6"}]},{"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"anb","text":"6"}]},{"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"anc","text":"6"}]}]},{"_key":"and","style":"totalsPrimary","cells":[{"children":[]},{"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"ane","text":"Total ="}]},{"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"anf","text":"975"}]},{"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"ang","text":"906"}]}],"cellStyles":["monoPrimaryNowrap","monoPrimaryNowrap","monoPrimaryNowrap","monoPrimaryNowrap"]}],"note":{"style":"band","content":[{"_type":"block","_key":"am8","style":"normal","bare":true,"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"am9","text":"975 + 906 = 1881 = 19×99"}]}]}}]},{"_type":"appendixEvidence","_key":"ani","n":26,"marker":"primary","body":"evidenceBody","content":[{"_type":"block","_key":"anl","style":"normal","children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"ank","text":"Miraculously, if we calculate the sum of digits for every sura in the Quran, and multiply the sum for each sura by the sum of digits of its number of verses, instead of adding, we still end up with a grand total that is a multiple of 19. For example, Sura 2 has 286 verses. The sum of digits of 2+8+6=16. So you multiply 2 by 16, and you get 32, instead of adding 2+16 as we did in Item 26. This is done for every sura in the Quran. The grand total for all the suras is 7771, or 19×409. Once again, every single verse in the Quran is confirmed, while the false verses are utterly rejected. See Table 13."}]},{"_type":"appendixDataTable","_key":"ap4","caption":{"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"anm","text":"Table 13: Multiplication of the sum of digits of the Quran’s suras and verses"}]},"table":"collapse","columns":[{"header":{"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"anp","text":"Sura No."}]},"headerStyle":"leftNowrap","cellStyle":"tightMonoNowrapPrimary"},{"header":{"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"anq","text":"No. of Verses"}]},"headerStyle":"leftNowrap","cellStyle":"tightMonoNowrapFaded"},{"header":{"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"anr","text":"Σ Digits (Sura)"}]},"headerStyle":"leftNowrap","cellStyle":"tightMonoNowrapFaded"},{"header":{"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"ans","text":"Σ Digits (Verses)"}]},"headerStyle":"leftNowrap","cellStyle":"tightMonoNowrapFaded"},{"header":{"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"ant","text":"Product"}]},"headerStyle":"leftNowrap","cellStyle":"tightMonoNowrapFaded"}],"rows":[{"_key":"anu","style":"data","cells":[{"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"anv","text":"1"}]},{"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"anw","text":"7"}]},{"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"anx","text":"1"}]},{"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"any","text":"7"}]},{"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"anz","text":"7"}]}]},{"_key":"ao0","style":"data","cells":[{"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"ao1","text":"2"}]},{"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"ao2","text":"286"}]},{"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"ao3","text":"2"}]},{"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"ao4","text":"16"}]},{"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"ao5","text":"32"}]}]},{"_key":"ao6","style":"data","cells":[{"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"ao7","text":"3"}]},{"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"ao8","text":"200"}]},{"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"ao9","text":"3"}]},{"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"aoa","text":"2"}]},{"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"aob","text":"6"}]}]},{"_key":"aoc","style":"data","cells":[{"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"aod","text":"–"}]},{"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"aoe","text":"–"}]},{"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"aof","text":"–"}]},{"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"aog","text":"–"}]},{"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"aoh","text":"–"}]}]},{"_key":"aoi","style":"dat