r verse numbers is 10963, or 19×577. Sura 9 is the only sura that has 127 verses. See Table 15. If Sura 9 did consist of 129 verses, it would not be included in this list of suras, the total would be 10827 (10963-136), this phenomenon would have disappeared, and the Quran’s code would have been violated."}]},{"_type":"appendixDataTable","_key":"ars","caption":{"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"aqs","text":"Table 15: Mathematical coding of all suras consisting of 127 verses or less"}]},"table":"collapse","columns":[{"header":{"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"aqt","text":"Sura No."}]},"headerStyle":"leftNowrap","cellStyle":"tightMonoNowrapPrimary"},{"header":{"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"aqu","text":"No. of Verses"}]},"headerStyle":"leftNowrap","cellStyle":"tightMonoNowrapFaded"},{"header":{"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"aqv","text":"Total"}]},"headerStyle":"leftNowrap","cellStyle":"tightMonoNowrapFaded"}],"rows":[{"_key":"aqw","style":"data","cells":[{"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"aqx","text":"1"}]},{"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"aqy","text":"7"}]},{"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"aqz","text":"8"}]}]},{"_key":"ar0","style":"data","cells":[{"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"ar1","text":"5"}]},{"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"ar2","text":"120"}]},{"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"ar3","text":"125"}]}]},{"_key":"ar4","style":"data","cells":[{"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"ar5","text":"8"}]},{"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"ar6","text":"75"}]},{"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"ar7","text":"83"}]}]},{"_key":"ar8","style":"data","cells":[{"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"ar9","text":"9"}]},{"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"ara","text":"127"}]},{"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"arb","text":"136"}]}]},{"_key":"arc","style":"data","cells":[{"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"ard","text":"–"}]},{"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"are","text":"–"}]},{"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"arf","text":"–"}]}]},{"_key":"arg","style":"data","cells":[{"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"arh","text":"113"}]},{"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"ari","text":"5"}]},{"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"arj","text":"118"}]}]},{"_key":"ark","style":"data","cells":[{"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"arl","text":"114"}]},{"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"arm","text":"6"}]},{"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"arn","text":"120"}]}]},{"_key":"aro","style":"totalsPrimary","cells":[{"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"arp","text":"6434"}]},{"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"arq","text":"4529"}]},{"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"arr","text":"10963 = 19×577"}]}],"cellStyles":["monoPrimaryNowrap","monoPrimaryNowrap","monoPrimaryNowrap"]}]}]},{"_type":"appendixEvidence","_key":"art","n":29,"marker":"primary","body":"evidenceBody","content":[{"_type":"block","_key":"arw","style":"normal","children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"arv","text":"Since Sura 9 is odd-numbered, and its number of verses is also odd, let us look at all the odd-numbered suras whose number of verses is also odd. This gives us 27 suras: 1, 9, 11, 13, 15, 17, 25, 27, 29, 33, 35, 39, 43, 45, 57, 63, 81, 87, 91, 93, 97, 101, 103, 105, 107, 111, and 113. They consist of 7, 127, 123, 43, 99, 111, 77, 93, 69, 73, 45, 75, 89, 37, 29, 11, 29, 19, 15, 11, 5, 11, 3, 5, 7, 5, and 5 verses, respectively. The sum of these sura numbers, plus their sum of verse numbers is 2774, 19×146. If we take the wrong number of verses for Sura 9, i.e., 129, this miracle disappears."}]}]},{"_type":"appendixEvidence","_key":"arx","n":30,"marker":"primary","body":"evidenceBody","content":[{"_type":"block","_key":"as0","style":"normal","children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"arz","text":"The correct number of verses in Sura 9 is 127, and this is a prime number — it is not divisible by any number except 1, and itself. Let us look at all the suras whose number of verses is a prime number. These are Suras 1, 9, 13, 33, 43, 45, 57, 63, 81, 87, 93, 97, 101, 103, 105, 107, 111, and 113. The numbers of verses in these suras are 7, 127, 43, 73, 89, 37, 29, 11, 29, 19, 11, 5, 11, 3, 5, 7, 5, and 5, respectively. If you add the digits of these suras, you get 137, while the digits of the verses add up to 129. This makes the grand total of all the digits 137+129 = 266 = 19×14."}]}]},{"_type":"appendixEvidence","_key":"as1","n":31,"marker":"primary","body":"evidenceBody","content":[{"_type":"block","_key":"as4","style":"normal","children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"as3","text":"The distorters added two false verses to Sura 9, and this caused the sura to have 129 verses. Since 129 consists of 3 digits, and is divisible by 3, let us look at the suras whose number of verses is divisible by 3, and consists of 3 digits. The total of these sura numbers is 71, and the total number of verses is 765. This produces a grand total of 71 + 765 = 836, or 19×44. The data are shown in Table 16."}]},{"_type":"appendixDataTable","_key":"at1","caption":{"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"as5","text":"Table 16: All suras whose number of verses is 3 digit, and is divisible by 3"}]},"table":"collapse","columns":[{"header":{"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"as6","text":"Sura No."}]},"headerStyle":"leftNowrap","cellStyle":"tightMonoNowrapPrimary"},{"header":{"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"as7","text":"# of Verses"}]},"headerStyle":"leftNowrap","cellStyle":"tightMonoNowrapFaded"},{"header":{"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"as8","text":"Total"}]},"headerStyle":"leftNowrap","cellStyle":"tightMonoNowrapFaded"}],"rows":[{"_key":"as9","style":"data","cells":[{"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"asa","text":"5"}]},{"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"asb","text":"120"}]},{"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"asc","text":"125"}]}]},{"_key":"asd","style":"data","cells":[{"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"ase","text":"6"}]},{"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"asf","text":"165"}]},{"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"asg","text":"171"}]}]},{"_key":"ash","style":"data","cells":[{"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"asi","text":"11"}]},{"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"asj","text":"123"}]},{"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"ask","text":"134"}]}]},{"_key":"asl","style":"data","cells":[{"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"asm","text":"12"}]},{"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"asn","text":"111"}]},{"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"aso","text":"123"}]}]},{"_key":"asp","style":"data","cells":[{"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"asq","text":"17"}]},{"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"asr","text":"111"}]},{"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"ass","text":"128"}]}]},{"_key":"ast","style":"data","cells":[{"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"asu","text":"20"}]},{"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"asv","text":"135"}]},{"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"asw","text":"155"}]}]},{"_key":"asx","style":"totalsPrimary","cells":[{"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"asy","text":"71"}]},{"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"asz","text":"765"}]},{"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"at0","text":"836 = 19×44"}]}],"cellStyles":["monoPrimaryNowrap","monoPrimaryNowrap","monoPrimaryNowrap"]}]},{"_type":"block","_key":"at3","style":"normal","children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"at2","text":"If Sura 9 had 129 verses, it would have been included in this table, and would have destroyed this phenomenon."}]}]},{"_type":"appendixEvidence","_key":"at4","n":32,"marker":"primary","body":"evidenceBody","content":[{"_type":"block","_key":"at7","style":"normal","children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"at6","text":"If Sura 9 consisted of 129 verses, as the falsifiers would like us to believe, then let us look at all the suras which consist of 129 verses or more. There are 8 such suras. Their data are shown Table 17. If Sura 9 consisted of 129 verses, the total number of verses would have been 1577 + 129 = 1706, not a multiple of 19."}]},{"_type":"appendixDataTable","_key":"au2","caption":{"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"at8","text":"Table 17: All t