dd up to 10. These are suras 9, 45, 54, and 72. They consist of 127, 37, 55, and 28 verses, respectively. The total number of verses in these three suras is 247, 19×13. If Sura 9 consisted of 129 verses, it would not be included in this table to begin with. See Table 21."}]},{"_type":"appendixDataTable","_key":"ay6","caption":{"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"axo","text":"Table 21: All the suras where the digits of sura number add up to 9 and the digits of number of verses add up to 10"}]},"table":"collapse","columns":[{"header":{"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"axp","text":"Sura No."}]},"headerStyle":"leftNowrap","cellStyle":"tightMonoNowrapPrimary"},{"header":{"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"axq","text":"No. of Verses"}]},"headerStyle":"leftNowrap","cellStyle":"tightMonoNowrapFaded"}],"rows":[{"_key":"axr","style":"data","cells":[{"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"axs","text":"9"}]},{"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"axt","text":"127"}]}]},{"_key":"axu","style":"data","cells":[{"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"axv","text":"45"}]},{"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"axw","text":"37"}]}]},{"_key":"axx","style":"data","cells":[{"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"axy","text":"54"}]},{"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"axz","text":"55"}]}]},{"_key":"ay0","style":"data","cells":[{"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"ay1","text":"72"}]},{"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"ay2","text":"28"}]}]},{"_key":"ay3","style":"totalsPrimary","cells":[{"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"ay4","text":"Total ="}]},{"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"ay5","text":"247 = 19×13"}]}],"cellStyles":["monoPrimaryNowrap","monoPrimaryNowrap"]}]}]},{"_type":"appendixEvidence","_key":"ay7","n":38,"marker":"primary","body":"evidenceBody","content":[{"_type":"block","_key":"aya","style":"normal","children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"ay9","text":"If Sura 9 consisted of 129 verses as the distorters claimed, then there is only one other sura in the whole Quran whose sura digits add up to 9, and its number of verses’ digits add up to 12, namely Sura 27. As shown in Table 22, this combination, with 129 verses for Sura 9, does not conform with the Quran’s code."}]},{"_type":"appendixDataTable","_key":"ayp","caption":{"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"ayb","text":"Table 22: The suras where the digits of sura number add up to 9, and the digits of number of verses add up to 12, assuming that Sura 9 is 129 verses"}]},"table":"collapse","columns":[{"header":{"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"aye","text":"Sura No."}]},"headerStyle":"leftNowrap","cellStyle":"tightMonoNowrapPrimary"},{"header":{"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"ayf","text":"No. of Verses"}]},"headerStyle":"leftNowrap","cellStyle":"tightMonoNowrapFaded"}],"rows":[{"_key":"ayg","style":"data","cells":[{"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"ayh","text":"9"}]},{"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"ayi","text":"129"}]}]},{"_key":"ayj","style":"data","cells":[{"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"ayk","text":"27"}]},{"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"ayl","text":"93"}]}]},{"_key":"aym","style":"totalsPrimary","cells":[{"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"ayn","text":"Total ="}]},{"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"ayo","text":"222"}]}],"cellStyles":["monoPrimaryNowrap","monoPrimaryNowrap"]}],"note":{"style":"band","content":[{"_type":"block","_key":"ayc","style":"normal","bare":true,"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"ayd","text":"(not a multiple of 19)"}]}]}}]},{"_type":"appendixEvidence","_key":"ayq","n":39,"marker":"primary","body":"evidenceBody","content":[{"_type":"block","_key":"ayt","style":"normal","children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"ays","text":"Let us assume for awhile that Sura 9 consists of 129 verses. Since the number 129 ends with the digit “9,” let us look at all the suras where the number of verses ends with the digit “9.” We find 13 suras in the Quran whose number of verses ends with the digit “9.” They are Suras 10, 15, 29, 43, 44, 48, 52, 57, 81, 82, 87, 96, and 104. Their numbers of verses are 109, 99, 69, 89, 59, 29, 49, 29, 29, 19, 19, 19, and 9, respectively. As illustrated by Table 23, many conform with the Quran’s code only if Sura 9 is excluded; it does not consist of 129 verses. Without Sura 9, the total number of verses in these 13 suras is 627, 19×33. Additionally, the sura number, plus the number of verses, plus the sum the sum of verse numbers, add up to 23655, or 19×1245. These phenomena would have disappeared if Sura 9 consisted of 129 verses."}]},{"_type":"appendixDataTable","_key":"a10x","caption":{"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"ayu","text":"Table 23: All suras whose number of verses end with the digit “9”"}]},"table":"collapse","columns":[{"header":{"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"ayv","text":"Sura No."}]},"headerStyle":"leftNowrap","cellStyle":"tightMonoNowrapPrimary"},{"header":{"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"ayw","text":"No. of Verses"}]},"headerStyle":"leftNowrap","cellStyle":"tightMonoNowrapFaded"},{"header":{"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"ayx","text":"Sum of Verse #’s"}]},"headerStyle":"leftNowrap","cellStyle":"tightMonoNowrapFaded"},{"header":{"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"ayy","text":"Total"}]},"headerStyle":"leftNowrap","cellStyle":"tightMonoNowrapFaded"}],"rows":[{"_key":"ayz","style":"data","cells":[{"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"az0","text":"10"}]},{"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"az1","text":"109"}]},{"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"az2","text":"5995"}]},{"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"az3","text":"6114"}]}]},{"_key":"az4","style":"data","cells":[{"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"az5","text":"15"}]},{"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"az6","text":"99"}]},{"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"az7","text":"4950"}]},{"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"az8","text":"5064"}]}]},{"_key":"az9","style":"data","cells":[{"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"aza","text":"29"}]},{"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"azb","text":"69"}]},{"children":[{"_type":"span","_ke